      "text": "That confirms it.\n\nFixed points audio *has* to normalize to 1.\n\nI've become a big fan of floating point audio as a side effect of this.\n\nThe default for the project is to encode as [float] and do the math in [double].\n\nThe extra precision during production makes things sound nicer."
